# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [0.1.0] - 2026-09-07

### Added

- Git aliases (`git/aliases.sh` for bash/zsh, `git/aliases.ps1` for PowerShell) for common git commands (add, clone, checkout, commit, diff, fetch, push, pull, status, log, branch, switch, restore, stash, stash pop, reset, rebase, merge).

## [0.0.1] - 2026-09-07

### Added

- Initial version of the project with VS Code configurations included.
